OL,4,CHunger Games fan, 13, to get artwork   
OL,5,Cshown on cinema screens before film    
OL,6,GA teenage Hunger Games fan has met the 
OL,7,Gcast of the new film after her artwork 
OL,8,Gwon a competition, meaning it will be  
OL,9,Gdisplayed at every cinema screening    
OL,10,Gacross the UK.                         
OL,12,FFreja Brown, 13, won the British Board 
OL,13,Fof Film Classification's (BBFC) create 
OL,14,Fthe card competition, which ran ahead  
OL,15,Fof the release of The Hunger Games:    
OL,16,FSunrise on the Reaping - the sixth     
OL,17,Ffilm in the franchise.                 
OL,19,FFreja, from Cardiff, beat more than    
OL,20,F1,000 entries from across the UK and   
OL,21,Fsaid she was "so grateful" to be       
OL,22,Fchosen.                                
